 novel / light novel narration (Novel Explainer) — growing, lower comp` \r\n376: \r\n377: ```\r\n378: ## Final Verdict\r\n379: ```\r\n380: \r\n381: ```\r\n382: Niche is real. Hindi is the entry gap. Production model (90% AI + long-form\r\n383: + volume) is the highest-risk version. Win by adding genuine human editorial\r\n384: authorship — not pure automation.\r\n385: ```\r\n386: \r\n387: ##### `SOURCES:` \r\n388: \r\n389: - `YouTube monetization policies: support.google.com/youtube/answer/1311392` \r\n390: \r\n391: - `r/YouTubeCreators audiobook auto-rejection` \r\n392: \r\n393: - `r/youtube mass AI cleanup` \r\n394: \r\n395: - `r/PartneredYoutube inauthentic content guidelines` \r\n396: \r\n397: - `r/aitubers Veo 3 monetization` \r\n398: \r\n399: - `r/COPYRIGHT reading books on YouTube strike` \r\n400: \r\n401: - `r/ElevenLabs AI voice demonetization concern` \r\n402: \r\n403: - `Quora book summary copyright` \r\n404: \r\n405: - `uppbeat.io most profitable niches (RPM estimate)` \r\n406: \r\n407: Want me to go a layer deeper on any single piece — say, a specific mitigation blueprint for surviving the inauthentic-content review, or a keyword/tag package for your first Hindi book-summary video? 🎯 \r\n408: \r\n409: https://app.vidiq.com/ai-coach/01a0be03-0275-7021-af5d-def5cbb7db48 \r\n410: \r\n411: 6/6 \r\n412: \r\n413: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
